1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,232
Rolled your ankle?

2
00:00:01,232 --> 00:00:03,087
Here's the first aid for a sprain.

3
00:00:06,250 --> 00:00:06,790
Step one.

4
00:00:06,790 --> 00:00:07,089
Rest.

5
00:00:07,089 --> 00:00:09,487
Stop, and take the weight off the ankle.

6
00:00:09,487 --> 00:00:10,986
Don't try to walk it off.

7
00:00:12,250 --> 00:00:12,796
Step two.

8
00:00:12,796 --> 00:00:16,620
Ice it for fifteen to twenty minutes, every two to three hours.

9
00:00:16,620 --> 00:00:20,079
Wrap the ice in a cloth, never place it directly on skin.

10
00:00:20,780 --> 00:00:21,460
Step three.

11
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:22,015
Compress.

12
00:00:22,015 --> 00:00:27,884
Wrap the ankle in a firm elastic bandage, but not so tight that it hurts or the toes turn numb.

13
00:00:28,580 --> 00:00:29,189
Step four.

14
00:00:29,189 --> 00:00:29,676
Elevate.

15
00:00:29,676 --> 00:00:33,572
When resting, raise the foot above hip level to reduce swelling.

16
00:00:34,580 --> 00:00:39,226
Can't put weight on it, or have severe pain, a misshapen joint, or numbness?

17
00:00:39,226 --> 00:00:40,266
Get medical care.

18
00:00:40,266 --> 00:00:43,689
And see a doctor if it isn't improving after a few days.
